      "hizbQuarter": 121,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2226,
      "text": "until when he reached the far west, he found the sun setting in a dark body of water, and he found some people nearby. We said, “O Dhul-Qarnayn, either punish them or treat them with kindness.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 303,
      "ruku": 262,
      "hizbQuarter": 121,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2227,
      "text": "He said, “As for one who does wrong[43], we will punish him, then he will be brought back to his Lord, and He will punish him grievously.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 303,
      "ruku": 262,
      "hizbQuarter": 121,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2228,
      "text": "But he who believes and does righteous deeds, he will have the best reward[44], and we will enjoin upon him to do what is easy.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 303,
      "ruku": 262,
      "hizbQuarter": 121,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2229,
      "text": "Then he pursued another course,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 18,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الكَهۡفِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Kahf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cave",
        "numberOfAyahs": 110,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
